 "title": "【幻の理想郷】世界に存在した5つの短命国家の独立と終焉【ゆっくり解説】",
 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/n9NUThVy4fA/maxresdefault.webp",
 "description": "「消えた国家」たちの物語。幕末の侍が築いた蝦夷共和国、第一次大戦後の混乱に生まれたバイエルン・レーテ共和国、ガリバルディが率いたジュリアナ共和国…。短命に終わった理想国家を紹介します。\n\n参考記事\n①蝦夷共和国\n榎本武揚と明治維新　黒瀧秀久　岩波ジュニア新書\n\n五稜郭の歴史（箱館戦争から現在）\nhttps://www.city.hakodate.hokkaido.jp/docs/2014011700789/\n\n五稜郭の歴史\nhttps://www.goryokaku-tower.co.jp/history/\n\n\n②バイエルン・レーテ（＝ソビエト）共和国\n\nErnst Toller and German Society: Intellectuals as Leaders and Critics, 1914-1939 1611476356, 9781611476354.\nhttps://dokumen.pub/qdownload/ernst-toller-and-german-society-intellectuals-as-leaders-and-critics-1914-1939-1611476356-9781611476354.html\n\nRäterepublik Baiern (1919)\nhttps://www.historisches-lexikon-bayerns.de/Lexikon/R%C3%A4terepublik_Baiern_%281919%29\n\nRoter Terror, 1919\nhttps://www.historisches-lexikon-bayerns.de/Lexikon/Roter_Terror%2C_1919\n\nOrdnung durch Terror: Zerschlagung der Räterepublik\nhttps://www.nsdoku.de/lexikon/artikel/zerschlagung-der-raeterepublik-909\n\nPalmsonntagsputsch, 13. April 1919\nhttps://www.historisches-lexikon-bayerns.de/Lexikon/Palmsonntagsputsch%2C_13._April_1919\n\nRote Armee, 1919\nhttps://www.historisches-lexikon-bayerns.de/Lexikon/Rote_Armee%2C_1919\n\nMeet the Freikorps: Vanguard of Terror 1918-1923\nhttps://www.nationalww2museum.org/war/articles/meet-freikorps-vanguard-terror-1918-1923\n\nKurt Eisner’s assassination\nhttps://www.muenchner-stadtmuseum.de/en/revolutionary-and-state-premier-kurt-eisner-1867-1919/chapter-10-kurt-eisners-assassination\n\n\n③ジュリアナ共和国\n\nENTRE CONTRABANDO E AMBIGÜIDADES: OUTROS ASPECTOS DA REPÚBLICA JULIANA\nhttps://repositorio.ufsc.br/bitstream/123456789/89551/1/226543.pdf\n\nDistintos e Dislexos? O Papel das Elites Locais na República Juliana\nhttps://ojs.sites.ufsc.br/index.php/sceh/article/view/105/170\n\nCaderno de Anita – Bicentenário (Anita Garibaldi 200 anos)\nhttps://cultura.rs.gov.br/upload/arquivos/carga20210420/23092012-caderno-de-anita.pdf\n\nMemórias e Narrativas Negras na Cidade de Laguna/Sul do Brasil\nhttps://revistas.usp.br/sankofa/article/download/207539/190900\n\n\n④カルナーロ＝イタリア執政府（Reggenza Italiana del Carnaro）\n\nLa Carta del Carnaro: un centenario in sordina\nhttps://www.nomos-leattualitaneldiritto.it/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Ferrari-3-2020-REV-2.pdf\n\nCarta del Carnaro: Diritti di libertà e prospettive di giustizia sociale nella Fiume dannunziana\nhttps://dialnet.unirioja.es/descarga/articulo/8179621.pdf\n\nCento anni dalla Carta del Carnaro: nuove suggestioni costituzionali\nhttps://www.forumcostituzionale.it/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/41-Fricano-FQC-1-21.pdf\n\nPrincipi economici nella Carta del Carnaro\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Carmelo_Ferlito4/publication/265251521_Principi_economici_nella_Carta_del_Carnaro/links/540680ac0cf2c48563b253dd/Principi-economici-nella-Carta-del-Carnaro.pdf\n\nRepublic of Fiume – The quest of (national/imaginary) identity\nhttps://www.csend.org/images/articles/files/Republic%20of%20Fiume%20D%27Annunzio%20RS.pdf\n\n\n\n⑤アイスランド自由独立国\nIceland’s “Dog-Days King”: The Nine Week Summer Republic\nhttps://www.7dayadventurer.com/2019/01/03/icelands-dog-days-king-the-nine-week-summer-republic/\n\nJørgen Jørgensen (1780-1841) - explorer and convict\nhttp://www.danesinaustralia.com/jorgen-jorgensen.html\n\nJørgen Jørgensen: The Convict King\nhttps://www.ourtasmania.com.au/northwest/history-jorgensen.html\n\nJørgen Jørgensen: the King of Iceland\nhttps://www.readingmuseum.org.uk/blog/j%C3%B8rgen-j%C3%B8rgensen-king-iceland\n\nWhen Jørgen Jørgensen became the Dog Days King of Iceland\nhttps://yourfriendinreykjavik.com/when-jorgen-jorgensen-became-the-dog-days-king-of-iceland/\n\n\n【お知らせ】メンバーシップを開始しました！\nいつも応援ありがとうございます。\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります！\n\n▼ご参加お待ちしてます！\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\n